    rdfs:comment "The OpenMixer console's channel EQ, 8-band form: eight parametric bands (bell, shelves, notch, allpass) and a high-pass and a low-pass filter at 12 or 24 dB/oct, stereo, zero latency. The DSP is omx-dsp's <omxdsp/fx/omx_eq_instance.h>, the console's own EQ; every band ships off, so a racked instance is a wire." ;
